--     and SFD should be transmitted. Then, a 32-bit jam sequence should be transmitted.
-- 30. After some back-off period, queue up three 8-byte buffers. Then, start transmitting the frame.  
--     However, a collision is detected during preamble (collision 10).  Therefore, the rest of preamble 
--     and SFD should be transmitted. Then, a 32-bit jam sequence should be transmitted.
-- 31. After some back-off period, queue up three 8-byte buffers. Then, start transmitting the frame.  
